        },
        {
          "text": "Kinget pich löwïr cho kingötï cho le tïsï nko pipö Lawi nko ripi nko tumï nko mötwori Kö pö Tororöt* nko chane löwïr cho kisirö kegh pipö punton kïrïp kegh nko kirurut pö Tororöt, chane nko korukwa nko monekwa löwïr cho kikïchïreröchitu ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.10.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.10.28"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
